{'symbol': 'FANG', 'date': '2022-07-11 16:01:00', 'title': 'DIAMONDBACK ENERGY, INC. ANNOUNCES APPOINTMENTS TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'MIDLAND, TEXAS, JULY 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TRAVIS STICE, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE “BOARD”) OF DIAMONDBACK ENERGY, INC. (NASDAQ: FANG) ("DIAMONDBACK" OR THE "COMPANY"), IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT EFFECTIVE JULY 7, 2022, THE COMPANY INCREASED THE SIZE OF DIAMONDBACK\'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS TO TEN MEMBERS, ADDING REBECCA A. KLEIN AND FRANK D. TSURU AS INDEPENDENT DIRECTORS.'}